## 5. Important Product Decision: CSV Schema

The QSAR model and its required input schema have not been finalized. Therefore, the prototype must accept a **generic tabular CSV** and perform only general file/data checks.

Do not assume that every user file contains a `SMILES`, `activity`, `MolWt`, `LogP`, or any other fixed column. Do not require a particular scientific column name in v1.0.

The backend may report column names and data types, but it must not conclude that the file is suitable for a future QSAR model.

Suggested user-facing explanation:

> Untuk versi prototype, platform memeriksa struktur dasar file CSV. Pemeriksaan kesesuaian kolom dan analisis QSAR akan ditambahkan setelah format input model ditetapkan.

The product team must define the final QSAR input schema when the model pipeline is ready.

