## 13. Data Model (Prototype)

Suggested PostgreSQL table: `dataset_uploads`.

| Field | Suggested type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | Opaque dataset identifier |
| original_filename | VARCHAR | Sanitized original filename for display |
| stored_filename | VARCHAR | Generated UUID-based name on disk |
| storage_path | TEXT | Internal private path; never return to browser |
| file_size_bytes | BIGINT | Original file size |
| total_rows | BIGINT | Parsed data row count |
| total_columns | INTEGER | Parsed column count |
| columns | JSONB | Actual column names |
| missing_values_total | BIGINT | Total null/missing cells |
| missing_values_by_column | JSONB | Missing count by column |
| duplicate_rows | BIGINT | Duplicate rows count |
| validation_status | VARCHAR | valid / valid_with_warnings / rejected |
| warnings | JSONB | Warning messages |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Upload time |
| expires_at | TIMESTAMPTZ, nullable | Retention expiry if cleanup is enabled |

There is no user table or account relationship in v1.0.

